  "notes": "Bootstrap-3-era look with Font Awesome filled icons. Real-amount column renders each category as a full-width pill bar: red (#d9534f) when over budget showing % of budget, grey (#757272) showing raw amount when no budget set — always full-width, so the bar is really a coloured label rather than a proportional gauge. Category names carry small colour swatches. Planned budget inputs have a '+' sign-toggle button prefix. Per-row light-blue search button links to Reports filtered by category. Selected account in sidebar highlighted with a medium-blue fill; amounts in blue, negative in orange-red. Bank logos as square thumbnails. Right ~320px of the content area is empty."
